1) Read every file in raw/.
2) Identify all distinct concepts, ADRs, papers, people, themes.
3) Per tools/librarian/PROMPT.md, write/update one wiki page per atomic concept with [[wikilinks]] cross-references.
4) Rebuild wiki/_INDEX.md and wiki/_SOURCES.md from scratch.
5) Preserve any human-edited prose; do not clobber pages with status: human-curated frontmatter.
6) Report: total pages, deltas vs previous, any source files that produced no extractions (and why)."
                        ;;
                    *)
                        target="$1"
                        [[ -f "$KB_ROOT/$target" ]] || [[ -f "$KB_ROOT/raw/$target" ]] || target="raw/$target"
