Source file: $target
1) Read $target end-to-end.
2) Per tools/librarian/PROMPT.md, extract atomic concepts (one concept = one wiki page).
3) For each concept: create or update the relevant wiki/<section>/<Slug>.md with [[wikilinks]].
4) Append the source row to wiki/_SOURCES.md with extracted-articles wikilinks.
5) Update wiki/_INDEX.md to list any new pages.
6) Verify all new [[wikilinks]] resolve.
7) Report what was created vs updated."
                        ;;
                esac
                ;;
            lint)
                cd "$KB_ROOT"
                rdate=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)
                outdir="outputs/${rdate}_lint-report"
